Package: ragR
Title: Retrieval-Augmented Generation and RAG Evaluation Tools in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Muhammad Aimal", "Rehman", email = "rehman.aimal@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Zhili", "Lu", role = "aut"),
    person("Chi-Kuang", "Yeh", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides tools for document ingestion, embedding storage,
    retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), and RAG evaluation for question
    answering systems. The package includes an R-native vector store, wrappers
    for OpenAI embedding and chat-completion APIs, QA logging utilities, and
    LLM-scored RAGAS-style evaluation metrics.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/aimalrehman92/ragR
